{"id":"n56330-2-8","stage":1,"title":"바깥 · 外边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56330-2-8-1","ko":"우릴 언제까지 바깥에 세워 둘 거야?","zh":"你打算把我们一直放在外面到什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우릴","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바깥에","meaning":"外边，外面","explanation":"바깥：外边，外面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바깥","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56330","senseId":"2","lemma":"바깥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세워","meaning":"使处在","explanation":"세우다：使处在；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"21","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"e8ec56791b98c029","term":"바깥","zh":"外边，外面","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3","entryId":"56330","definition":"建筑外部没被遮住四周和天空的地方。","pronunciation":["바깓"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"使处在","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"使某个人来到某个位置。","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe0f707fda7d17752c42.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56330-2-8-2","ko":"아이고, 죄송합니다. 어서 들어오세요.","zh":"哎呀，实在对不起，请快进来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이고,","meaning":"哎哟","explanation":"아이고：哎哟","readings":[{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71354","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어서","meaning":"请，快","explanation":"어서：请，快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"2","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어오세요.","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0d494eb3dbdffe83","term":"아이고","zh":"哎哟","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3","entryId":"71354","definition":"疼痛、辛苦、惊讶、生气时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아이고"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"请，快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于喜悦地迎接或者诚恳地劝说。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/12fe344dc8c3f52c81a3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56330","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceScore":1.6076,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你打算把我们一直放在外面到什么时候？","哎呀，实在对不起，请快进来吧。","啊，承奎先生，好久不见啦！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你打算把我们一直放在外面到什么时候？","哎呀，实在对不起，请快进来吧。","啊，承奎先生，好久不见啦！"],"answer":1}]}
